# L23), row format 'path | element | capability | owner pack | date'. gates/060 refuses a
# row missing a field or a duplicate path; scripts/ggen_sync.sh --check-ledger refuses a
# row with no HANDWRITTEN.md entry. When a pack gains the capability, delete the row and
# the hand-written file in the same change.
